<view class="page">
  <view class="crumb">支部风采 › <text>党建风采</text></view>
  <view class="page-title">党建风采</view>
  <view class="page-sub">支部活动照片墙（数据来自后端 /gallery 页面）。</view>

  <view class="banner">
    <b>说明</b>
    <text>后端暂未提供风采 JSON 接口，本页解析的是服务端渲染的 /gallery 页面；照片标题与日期均来自后端。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view>
  <view class="empty" wx:elif="{{errMsg}}">{{errMsg}}</view>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="gal">
      <view class="gitem {{item.wide ? 'wide' : ''}}" wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id">
        <image class="gimg" wx:if="{{item.img}}" src="{{item.img}}" mode="aspectFill" />
        <view class="gph" wx:else>{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="gcap">
          <view class="gtitle">{{item.title}}</view>
          <view class="gsub" wx:if="{{item.sub}}">{{item.sub}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!list.length}}">暂无风采图片</view>
  </block>
</view>
